WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:05.759
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, I snagged a
bunch of your questions from my Telltale Games

00:00:05.759 --> 00:00:06.759
video.

00:00:06.759 --> 00:00:10.890
I picked a mixture of game, book and show
ones.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:13.310
Generally you guys all seemed pretty pumped
about it.

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:16.760
Like I said once the game actually drops in
December I’ll probably use it for a weekly

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:20.920
giveaway on my video game channel in addition
to the book giveaway here on my main channel.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:25.919
Also, I forgot to mention it, but the actor
that plays Syrio Forel was just cast in Star

00:00:25.919 --> 00:00:27.380
Wars Episode 7.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:31.439
So that’s two Game of Thrones actors, because
remember Gwendolyne Christie is also in it.

00:00:31.439 --> 00:00:37.690
I just did a big update for it so there will
be a link in the description for that.

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:42.239
Syrio Forel though, probably got cast as a
Jedi, you don’t cast a water dancer if you

00:00:42.239 --> 00:00:44.019
don’t want him to dance.

00:00:44.019 --> 00:00:47.559
There are so many God of Death jokes you could
make in the star wars universe since Jedi

00:00:47.559 --> 00:00:49.810
can transcend physical form.

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:50.810
But on to questions!

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:55.410
1 - Edward asks how closely will the game
be tied to season 5?

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:59.699
The game and the show will be separate, they
probably consulted each other a little just

00:00:59.699 --> 00:01:04.650
to see what things the show decided to include
next year, but the game is designed so that

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:08.140
the story isn’t super dependent on what
goes down on the show.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:12.791
They didn’t make it so you have to watch
the show to understand the game and you don’t

00:01:12.791 --> 00:01:14.550
have to buy the game to understand the show.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:16.060
The same is true for the books.

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:20.550
It will be a little closer to the show than
the Walking Dead game is.

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:24.720
But don’t expect to be hanging out with
the main characters the whole time.

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:28.760
And remember, decisions you make will affect
later interactions you have.

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:32.570
So You could turn the tide of a battle based
on which options you take.

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:36.040
2 - Vladimir asks will the game be free?

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:38.900
Only if you win one of my giveaways, seriously
though.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:41.520
It’s way cheaper than a typical console
game.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:46.480
In the United States for example, Destiny
on Xbox is about 60 US Dollars.

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:50.960
The Walking Dead Telltale Game in comparison
is only 25 US Dollars.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:53.670
You can buy a season pass to get all future
episodes.

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:58.770
Those are the content patches where they roll
out new story.

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:02.750
That’s an extra $15 US Dollars.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:05.180
Game Of Thrones will pretty much be the exact
same price.

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:12.240
I’ll be playing the Steam Version, just
because it’s more convenient, but which

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:13.270
ever country you live in.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:17.870
How ever much the walking dead game is, that’s
how much game of thrones will cost.

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:22.180
They haven’t confirmed the number of episodes
per season, but I’d expect it to be on par

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:23.590
with Walking Dead.

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:27.260
There were five episodes during season 2 this
year.

00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:31.350
3 - Space Gypsy asks are you implying you’re
Jon Snow?

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:37.020
I’m not sure what your talking about but
I do have the same birthday as Kit Harington.

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:43.050
4 - Tom Monty asks what date will Season 5
air in the UK?

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:45.530
Pretty much the same weekend Season 4 aired.

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:48.740
In the US that was April 6th, the first Sunday
in April.

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:51.090
So 2015 would make that April 5th.

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:57.070
I know international time zones make it weird,
but plan on the same premiere as last year.

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:58.211
They might bump it by a week.

00:02:58.211 --> 00:02:59.211
It won’t premiere till after True Detective
Season 2 finishes it’s run.

00:02:59.211 --> 00:03:00.211
So depending on when that premieres, it might
make them move Game of Thrones a little.

00:03:00.211 --> 00:03:01.211
They also premiered all the big trailers for
Season 4 during True Detective Episodes.

00:03:01.211 --> 00:03:02.211
So once that show comes back, we’ll start
getting the big season 5 trailers.

00:03:02.211 --> 00:03:06.140
5 - Paul Long asks, do you think a spoilery
battle in the game will go down the same way

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:07.530
it does in the books?

00:03:07.530 --> 00:03:10.760
I omitted the name just in case people skipped
the spoiler section in my earlier video.

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:12.030
Yes, the big Winds of Winter battle.

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:16.290
If the game goes that far it will depend entirely
on the decisions you make.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:20.730
Remember it’s choose your own adventure,
so you could completely derp big battles or

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:23.480
make all the right choices that make you win.

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:26.480
Once the game gets closer to release we’ll
probably have a better idea for the narrative

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:27.569
arc.

00:03:27.569 --> 00:03:36.000
I don’t think it will be exactly like the
show or the books.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:41.100
I will do more preview videos for the story
when they give us more info.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:46.190
6 - Matas asks Do you think Oberyn Poisoned
Tywin before his death?

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:51.520
No, but only because The Mountain was the
first person on his shit list.

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:55.630
Tywin was on his list, he just wasn’t the
first person.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:59.300
Had Oberyn lived, eventually he would have
totally killed Tywin.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:03.560
Presumably with his spear in the most painful
way possible.

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:08.830
Just run him through from the bottom end up.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:13.250
7 - Joe Byrne asks do you have a favorite
book in the series and could you rank them?

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:20.629
It’s been a little while since I finished
book 5 but I’d say that one.

00:04:20.629 --> 00:04:25.949
Dance with Dragons was the first book that
I anticipated, having read all the other books.

00:04:25.949 --> 00:04:29.460
Like if you started the series when the first
book was published in 1996.

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:35.180
You’d get to experience that long wait and
the crazy rush when they finally release it.

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:39.800
I expect that when winds of winter is released,
the trend will continue and that book will

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:41.220
be my new favorite.

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:44.740
But ranking all the books so far starting
with best to less best.

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:47.860
I wouldn’t say any of them are bad.

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:53.850
But Book 5, Book 4, Book 1, Book 2 and Book
3.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:57.300
Really it’s been so long since I’ve read
them that some of the events bleed together

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:58.300
in my brain.

00:04:58.300 --> 00:04:59.300
Mostly right now my brain is on books 4 and
5 because of where the show is.

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:03.249
A lot of times I have to go back and reference
the books if I forget when something happened.

00:05:03.249 --> 00:05:10.460
I’ll probably re-read book 4 and 5 before
next year though.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:16.379
8 - Justin Wang asks could you do a Room Tour
Video?

00:05:16.379 --> 00:05:22.690
Yes, I can’t remember which video, but I
did promise a room tour once it starts looking

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:24.379
like an actual place.

00:05:24.379 --> 00:05:28.559
Right now it’s still a bunch of boxes.

00:05:28.559 --> 00:05:32.059
I’d expect that to happen before October.

00:05:32.059 --> 00:05:33.879
So not too long.

00:05:33.879 --> 00:05:36.110
Definitely before I hit 500K subs.

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:41.629
I am planning a different special thing for
that event.

00:05:41.629 --> 00:05:48.509
9 - Sheam cc asks, do you think Theon could
be Azor Ahai?

00:05:48.509 --> 00:05:55.449
Right now based on the information we have
I think it’s Daenerys.

00:05:55.449 --> 00:05:58.009
She is the closest thing to an avatar of fire.

00:05:58.009 --> 00:06:00.779
That might change based on what happens during
Winds of Winter.

00:06:00.779 --> 00:06:05.189
But unless things take a dramatic left turn
I already have my ideas for who the champions

00:06:05.189 --> 00:06:06.930
of ice and fire will be.

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:10.339
It’s all in my White Walker Prophecy Video.

00:06:10.339 --> 00:06:14.930
I’ll add a link to that in the description
if you want to learn more about it.

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:19.069
I think Theon will be important.

00:06:19.069 --> 00:06:25.979
But mostly during the big spoiler battle in
Winds of Winter I talked about earlier today.

00:06:25.979 --> 00:06:32.580
10 - Kevin asks is it true that the actor
playing Jaqen H’Gar is coming back to the

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:33.580
show?

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:35.500
If so will he play the Kindly Man?

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:41.289
Yes it is true that the actor playing Jaqen
is back, since the show is going to be different

00:06:41.289 --> 00:06:45.409
from the books I think he could be a version
of the Kindly Man.

00:06:45.409 --> 00:06:49.490
But if you’re a book reader and it sounds
like your are, I really think Jaqen is the

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:52.870
Alchemist. and the Kindly Man is someone totally
different.

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:56.779
The show does tend to combine book characters
a lot, so it’s possible Jaqen could become

00:06:56.779 --> 00:07:00.099
an amalgam of a couple of the Faceless Men
characters.

00:07:00.099 --> 00:07:02.409
For those that don’t know, the Kindly Man
is one of the Faceless Men that has an implied

00:07:02.409 --> 00:07:03.409
leadership role in their order.

00:07:03.409 --> 00:07:05.710
The Faceless Men are the order of assassins
Jaqen belongs to.

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:12.949
I already did a video explaining them so I’ll
add a link in the description for that too.

00:07:12.949 --> 00:07:18.649
Since I originally planned to do a Faith Militant
video last week I’ll just make that my next

00:07:18.649 --> 00:07:20.270
